{"4270860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Furmageddon", "steam_appid": 4270860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/dd7e9cb2c9e08ec6366da03eb4ac8e64.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/dd7e9cb2c9e08ec6366da03eb4ac8e64.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything's exploding. The world's falling apart. Time to unleash some <strong>FURMAGEDDON</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through dangerous arenas filled with traps, elite enemies, and unpredictable encounters. Discover new weapons, abilities, outrageous upgrades, and devastating synergies to craft ridiculously overpowered builds and tear through endless enemy hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/65f02c123e85208c98ccd12b43ea6691.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/65f02c123e85208c98ccd12b43ea6691.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends, choosing from a cast of unique heroes, each with their own personality, strengths, and passive abilities. Experiment with powerful weapon combinations, craft overpowered builds, and survive increasingly challenging waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/222ead5308d3428118361f592e93ead4.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/222ead5308d3428118361f592e93ead4.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around fast-paced action, rewarding progression, and endless replayability, FURMAGEDDON delivers unpredictable runs, satisfying combat, and cooperative mayhem where no two adventures are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/3c1041c55afe84350b8965ed88cf5fa3.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/3c1041c55afe84350b8965ed88cf5fa3.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/648a012653526723f2c4c39dc26d746a.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/648a012653526723f2c4c39dc26d746a.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=1238 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/dd7e9cb2c9e08ec6366da03eb4ac8e64.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/dd7e9cb2c9e08ec6366da03eb4ac8e64.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything's exploding. The world's falling apart. Time to unleash some <strong>FURMAGEDDON</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through dangerous arenas filled with traps, elite enemies, and unpredictable encounters. Discover new weapons, abilities, outrageous upgrades, and devastating synergies to craft ridiculously overpowered builds and tear through endless enemy hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/65f02c123e85208c98ccd12b43ea6691.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/65f02c123e85208c98ccd12b43ea6691.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends, choosing from a cast of unique heroes, each with their own personality, strengths, and passive abilities. Experiment with powerful weapon combinations, craft overpowered builds, and survive increasingly challenging waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/222ead5308d3428118361f592e93ead4.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/222ead5308d3428118361f592e93ead4.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around fast-paced action, rewarding progression, and endless replayability, FURMAGEDDON delivers unpredictable runs, satisfying combat, and cooperative mayhem where no two adventures are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/3c1041c55afe84350b8965ed88cf5fa3.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/3c1041c55afe84350b8965ed88cf5fa3.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras/648a012653526723f2c4c39dc26d746a.avif?t=1788014898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/extras_big/648a012653526723f2c4c39dc26d746a.webp?t=1788014898 width=1560 height=1238 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Ha-ha! I'm a genius! I hacked the devs Steam page! 🦝 Raccoon Rizzo in da house. If you want in on the craziest co-op adventure around, toss a few coins my way! Pick your Furmate, build ridiculous loadouts, and unleash total fury &amp; mayhem!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/48efc23bd0d454ff7d46243aaf1dc135daa47785/header.jpg?t=1788014898", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/db500a101ad3c86a4d18ef930d528ba4555ea5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788014898", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4270860/db500a101ad3c86a4d18ef930d528ba4555ea5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788014898", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS Version: Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Meta Quest 3</li></ul>"